{"seq":2,"slug":"merging-intuition","title":"权重空间与线性模式连通：合并为什么不是灾难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/foundations/merging-intuition","wordCount":1987,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"权重空间与线性模式连通-合并为什么不是灾难\">权重空间与线性模式连通：合并为什么不是灾难</h1><p>把两个训练好的网络的权重取中点，按朴素直觉应该得到一个「四不像」——毕竟神经网络是高度非线性的，参数空间坑坑洼洼，两点之间的连线大概率要穿过一片高损失的荒原。可实验一次次表明：只要两个模型共享同一个预训练起点、只是微调分叉，它们之间的连线几乎是平的，中点模型的损失和两端一样低。这个现象叫<strong>线性模式连通</strong>（linear mode connectivity, LMC），它是全部模型合并方法得以成立的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型合并的地基是<strong>线性模式连通</strong>（LMC）：只要两个模型共享同一个预训练起点、只是微调分叉，它们权重连线上的损失几乎处处很低，中点模型的损失与两端一样低。这条性质由三个层层递进的概念支撑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;盆地 basin&lt;br/&gt;低损失连通区&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;同基座微调&lt;br/&gt;大概率同盆地&lt;br/&gt;可直接插值&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;置换对称性&lt;br/&gt;同一函数有海量等价副本&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;独立预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;可能停在不同副本&lt;br/&gt;需先对齐&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;位移即任务向量 τ&lt;br/&gt;方向不打架可叠加&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;可做代数&lt;br/&gt;合并方法的共同语言&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"盆地 basin&lt;br/&gt;低损失连通区\"] --&gt; B[\"同基座微调&lt;br/&gt;大概率同盆地&lt;br/&gt;可直接插值\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"置换对称性&lt;br/&gt;同一函数有海量等价副本\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"独立预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;可能停在不同副本&lt;br/&gt;需先对齐\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"位移即任务向量 τ&lt;br/&gt;方向不打架可叠加\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"可做代数&lt;br/&gt;合并方法的共同语言\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>盆地</strong>：高维过参数化网络收敛到的不是一个孤立点，而是一片连通的低损失区域；同盆地内部线性插值处处低损失，这是权重平均敢于取均值的底气。</li>\n<li><strong>置换对称性</strong>：隐藏单元可任意重新编号，同一个函数在权重空间里存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_l h_l!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span> 个等价副本；两个独立模型「合不动」往往不是真在不同盆地，而是停在了不同副本上，需先求置换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 对齐神经元（Git Re-Basin 的思路）。</li>\n<li><strong>任务向量</strong>：微调位移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>ft</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\theta_{\\text{ft}} - \\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ft</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把「这次微调学到了什么」变成可运算的对象；位移方向不打架时可叠加成多能力模型，打架时产生参数干扰。</li>\n<li><strong>范数与缩放</strong>：LMC 只保证路径低损失，不保证等权平均最优；各模型位移范数可能相差数倍，这是加权合并与球面插值 SLERP 的动机。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"损失地形里的-盆地\">损失地形里的「盆地」</h2><p>要理解 LMC，先要放弃「损失地形是一堆孤立尖峰」的错觉。对高维过参数化网络而言，训练收敛到的不是一个孤立的点，而是一片连通的低损失区域——常被形象地称为「盆地」（basin）。同一个盆地内部，不同的解通过一条低损失路径相连。</p>\n<p>关键在于：从同一个预训练权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出发、在不同数据上做温和微调，得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大概率仍落在<strong>同一个盆地</strong>里。既然同盆地内部处处低损失，那么它们的线性插值</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta(\\alpha) = (1-\\alpha)\\,\\theta_A + \\alpha\\,\\theta_B, \\quad \\alpha \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>整条路径也就都在低损失区，中点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 自然是个好模型。这正是 <a href=\"../methods/weight-averaging\">权重平均</a> 敢于直接取平均的底气所在。反过来，两个<strong>从头独立预训练</strong>（不同随机初始化）的模型不共享盆地，直接插值就会掉进高损失的「势垒」，中点模型接近随机——这也解释了为什么合并的硬前提是同基座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置换对称性-同一个函数的无数副本\">置换对称性：同一个函数的无数副本</h2><p>那两个独立训练的网络就永远合不了吗？这里藏着模型合并理论最漂亮的一环——<strong>置换对称性</strong>（permutation symmetry）。神经网络的隐藏单元是可以任意重新编号的：把某一层的神经元及其对应的输入输出权重同步做一次排列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，网络计算的函数完全不变，但权重张量在参数空间里被搬到了一个看似遥远的另一个点。</p>\n<p>这意味着，一个功能上等价的解，在权重空间里存在着数量高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_l h_l!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 层宽度）个的排列副本。两个独立训练的网络之所以插值会穿过势垒，往往不是因为它们真的在不同盆地，而是因为它们停在了同一盆地的<strong>不同置换副本</strong>上。只要先找到一个合适的排列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，把模型 B 的神经元重新对齐到模型 A 的编号约定，再插值，势垒就会消失。这就是 2022 年 Ainsworth 等人 &quot;Git Re-Basin&quot; 工作的核心思想：合并前先「回到同一个盆地」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[两个待合并模型] --&gt; B{是否共享&lt;br/&gt;预训练基座?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[大概率同盆地&lt;br/&gt;直接线性插值即可]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[可能停在不同置换副本]&#10;    D --&gt; E[求置换 P 对齐神经元&lt;br/&gt;Git Re-Basin]&#10;    E --&gt; F[对齐后落入同盆地]&#10;    C --&gt; G[中点模型低损失]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[合并可行]\">flowchart TD\n    A[两个待合并模型] --&gt; B{是否共享&lt;br/&gt;预训练基座?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[大概率同盆地&lt;br/&gt;直接线性插值即可]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[可能停在不同置换副本]\n    D --&gt; E[求置换 P 对齐神经元&lt;br/&gt;Git Re-Basin]\n    E --&gt; F[对齐后落入同盆地]\n    C --&gt; G[中点模型低损失]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[合并可行]</pre><h2 id=\"三种对齐关系的对比\">三种对齐关系的对比</h2><p>把上面几种情形整理成一张表，能帮助判断手头两个模型「合不合得动」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型来源</th>\n<th>是否共享盆地</th>\n<th>直接插值结果</th>\n<th>需要的前置处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同基座、不同任务微调</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中点低损失，可用</td>\n<td>无（本 hub 主战场）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同基座、不同随机种子微调</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中点低损失，鲁棒性反升</td>\n<td>无（model soup 场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立预训练、相同架构</td>\n<td>否（不同置换副本）</td>\n<td>中点接近随机</td>\n<td>先做神经元置换对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不同架构</td>\n<td>参数不对应</td>\n<td>无法定义</td>\n<td>无解，不能合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两行是本 hub 绝大多数方法的适用场景，也是为什么我们反复强调「同基座」。第三行是 Git Re-Basin 类研究的战场，工程上较少直接用于大语言模型，但它是理解「盆地」概念的重要一课。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从几何直觉到任务向量\">从几何直觉到任务向量</h2><p>LMC 还给出了另一个更实用的视角。既然微调只是在盆地内的小位移，那么这个位移向量本身就承载了「这次微调学到的东西」。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>ft</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\theta_{\\text{ft}} - \\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ft</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它指向盆地内从起点到微调终点的方向。多个微调的位移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_A, \\tau_B, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 若近似正交或至少不反向，它们的和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0 + \\sum_i \\lambda_i \\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍留在盆地内，于是能力得以叠加。这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是任务向量，它把「几何直觉」转化成「可做代数」的对象——其完整定义、加减法与类比性质是 <a href=\"../methods/task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a> 的主题，这里只点明它源自 LMC。</p>\n<p>而当位移之间<strong>并不</strong>近似正交、方向互相打架时，简单相加就会互相抵消或放大噪声，这就是参数干扰的几何根源，也是 <a href=\"../methods/ties-dare\">TIES 与 DARE</a> 从符号与稀疏两个角度动手术的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常被忽视的细节-范数与缩放\">一个常被忽视的细节：范数与缩放</h2><p>LMC 保证的是「路径低损失」，但没保证「等权平均就是最优点」。实际中，不同微调的位移范数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\tau\\|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span></span></span></span> 可能相差数倍——学习率高、训练久的微调位移更大，在等权平均里会「压过」位移小的模型。这解释了为什么进阶方法要引入按重要性加权（见 <a href=\"../advanced/fisher-regmean\">Fisher 与 RegMean</a>），以及为什么两模型合并时人们偏好保范数的球面插值 SLERP 而非线性插值。几何直觉告诉你「可以合」，但合得好不好，是范数与方向的精细账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线性模式连通（LMC）指同盆地内两解的线性插值路径处处低损失，是所有权重合并方法的地基。</li>\n<li>共享预训练基座的微调模型大概率同盆地，可直接插值；独立预训练的模型因落在不同置换副本而需先做神经元对齐（Git Re-Basin）。</li>\n<li>置换对称性说明一个函数在权重空间有海量等价副本，「合不动」常是没对齐而非真不同盆地。</li>\n<li>微调位移即任务向量，方向不打架时可叠加，打架时产生干扰。</li>\n<li>LMC 只保证路径低损失，不保证等权最优；范数差异催生了加权与球面插值等精细化方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>直接消费这一直觉的最简方法：<a href=\"../methods/weight-averaging\">权重平均与 SLERP</a></li>\n<li>把位移形式化为可运算对象：<a href=\"../methods/task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a></li>\n<li>全景地图，给每种方法定位：<a href=\"merging-taxonomy\">谱系</a></li>\n<li>跨库延伸——微调如何在权重上留下这个位移：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/lora\">LLM 微调 · LoRA</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"权重空间与线性模式连通：合并为什么不是灾难","id":"权重空间与线性模式连通-合并为什么不是灾难"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"损失地形里的「盆地」","id":"损失地形里的-盆地"},{"level":2,"text":"置换对称性：同一个函数的无数副本","id":"置换对称性-同一个函数的无数副本"},{"level":2,"text":"三种对齐关系的对比","id":"三种对齐关系的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"从几何直觉到任务向量","id":"从几何直觉到任务向量"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常被忽视的细节：范数与缩放","id":"一个常被忽视的细节-范数与缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何模型合并：用算术代替训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/foundations/why-model-merging"},"next":{"title":"谱系：给每一种合并方法找到坐标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/foundations/merging-taxonomy"}}